<title>CHINA: China sugar-growing areas rises by 3.0 percent.</title>
<headline>China sugar-growing areas rises by 3.0 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The area of cultivated land under sugar crops rose by 3.0 percent in 1996 according to State Statistical Bureau figures available at the end of August, the Financial News said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The area under sugar increased by 60,000 hectares from a year earlier, it said.</p>
